  << /ActualText (I\047m a UI\057UX product designer with hands\055on frontend skills\054 working mainly on B2B systems and data\055dense interfaces\056 My work spans clarifying business rules\054 restructuring information architecture\054 and building both the high\055fidelity UI and the frontend that ships it\056 I split complex business logic into structure and parameters\054 so rule changes don\047t require re\055touching the system\056 On the handoff side\054 I build on a CTI token architecture\054 with file naming and component boundaries that map directly onto the frontend\047s CSS\057Sass\056)
